# Artifacts Directory

This directory contains screenshots and visual documentation of the OpenAI Status Monitor in action.

## Contents

- Workflow execution screenshots
- Slack notification examples
- State management visualizations
- Performance metrics

Place your screenshots here following the naming convention:
- `workflow_success.png` - Successful GitHub Actions run
- `slack_notification.png` - Example Slack notification
- `state_json.png` - State file example
- `logs_example.png` - Log output example
